# Client environment (copy to client/.env for local override - optional).
# In development leave this unset: the Vite proxy forwards /api to localhost:5000.
#
# In production (Vercel), set this as a project Environment Variable so the
# built client calls the deployed API. IMPORTANT: Vite reads this at BUILD
# time - set it in Vercel before deploying, or redeploy after changing it.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://pragadish-portfolio-api.onrender.com
